Load the full markdown body of one or more skills by name. The body is the
actual recipe — instructions, code patterns, anti-patterns — that tells you
how to accomplish the task.

Use AFTER discover_skills has surfaced candidate names. discover_skills
returns headers; read_skill opens them. Cap 5 names per call to keep the
context budget sane. Names that don't exist come back in `missing: [...]`,
not as an error.

Pairs with discover_skills the way pod_fetch pairs with pod_search.
